只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Discover The Best DSH plugins","id":"gh:1333290985","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-hub","slug":"coderPerseus/dsh-hub","topics":["awesome","awesome-list","deepseek","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Discover The Best DSH plugins"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Hub"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Discover, compare, and install DeepSeek Harness community plugins.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**English** | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Browse plugins · DeepSeek Harness · Report an issue"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Overview"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"DSH Hub is a community catalog for DeepSeek Harness plugins. It discovers installable packages on Gi"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"tHub and brings their descriptions, compatibility evidence, documentation, and installation commands"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" together in one place."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- Search by keyword, category, stars, recent updates, and compatibility status.\n- Compare plugin cap"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"abilities and inspect the original repository before installing.\n- Access the same static catalog th"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"rough the website, TypeScript client, CLI, or native Harness tools.\n- Submit a repository or report "},{"id":"p8s4","text":"outdated metadata through GitHub Issues."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Catalog discovery and refresh run daily. Repository descriptions remain source-authored; Chinese sum"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"maries and AI analysis are generated offline and invalidated when their source changes. Compatibilit"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"y labels show collected evidence, not a guarantee that a plugin will work in your environment."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Getting started"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Browse the website"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Open dshhub.org/en, search for a capability, and open a plugin to inspect its documentation and inst"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"n, search for a capability, and open a plugin to inspect its documentation and installation command."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Search from the terminal"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The static catalog now uses manifest schema 2. `index` points to a schema 2 directory containing `it"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"emCount` and ordered `shards` paths; each shard uses the schema 1 index shape with matching snapshot"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" metadata. Clients must combine all shards before searching or paginating. Browser-specific indexes "},{"id":"p14s4","text":"and detail shards remain independent. The repository client supports both the original single-file i"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"ndex and this format. Published client 0.2.0 cannot read the new directory; until a compatible npm r"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"elease is available, build and run the CLI from this repository:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Node.js 22+ and pnpm 10.34.5 are required. The old 0.1.0 dynamic API is retired."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Use with an agent"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The native search plugin exposes two read-only tools:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Tool | Purpose |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| `search_dsh_plugins` | Search by capability, category, and compatibility. |\n| `get_dsh_plugin` | I"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"nspect documentation, compatibility evidence, and installation commands. |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"See the plugin README for installation details. Use the latest source build until a shard-compatible"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" npm release is available. The repository's find-dsh-plugins skill provides the same workflow with a"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"s available. The repository's find-dsh-plugins skill provides the same workflow with a CLI fallback."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Example request:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"> Find a DeepSeek Harness plugin for cross-session memory, compare compatibility, and give me its in"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"arness plugin for cross-session memory, compare compatibility, and give me its installation command."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The search tools do not install results automatically."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Local development"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"After installing dependencies, restore the public catalog snapshot and start the static preview:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Open localhost:3000/en. Production serves pre-rendered HTML and JSON; public requests do not query a"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" database or run AI inference."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Directory | Responsibility |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| `apps/web` | Static website, browser search, and preview server |\n| `packages/catalog` | GitHub di"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"scovery, qualification, categories, and README generation |\n| `packages/client`, `packages/cli` | St"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"atic catalog SDK and command-line interface |\n| `packages/dsh-plugin` | Native Harness search tools "},{"id":"p30s4","text":"|\n| `scripts`, `data` | Catalog builds, offline enrichment, and publishing |\n| `apps/api`, `packages"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"/contracts` | Retained legacy API and contracts |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Run focused checks for catalog changes:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"For current architecture, snapshot recovery, and deployment, see Static catalog operations. Developm"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ent notes and Catalog pipeline also contain clearly marked legacy architecture references."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Use **Submit plugin** on the website to open the repository submission form. For an outdated listing"},{"id":"p35s2","text":", open an issue with the repository URL, incorrect fields, and current package or README evidence. M"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"aintainers can refresh a single repository without waiting for the rotating catalog refresh."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Pull requests for catalog accuracy, search, documentation, and the plugin ecosystem are welcome. Inc"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"lude the reason for the change and relevant validation."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Browse the generated category highlights"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Explore plugins by category"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Discover **18623 community plugins** across 11 categories. Each category highlights five plugins; op"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"en the category to search and browse the complete list."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"### agents · 6547"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"| Plugin | Description | Stars | Evidence |\n| --- | --- | ---: | --- |\n| @dshhubs/plugin-search | De"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"epSeek Harness tools for finding and inspecting plugins in the dshhub catalog | ★ 2 | declared |\n| @"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"deepseek-ai/dsh-acp | Automation-only Agent Client Protocol server for driving DeepSeek Harness agen"},{"id":"p41s4","text":"ts over JSON-RPC stdio | ★ 226042 | declared |\n| @open-design/dsh-runtime | DeepSeek Harness profile"},{"id":"p41s5","text":" runtime for OpenDesign | ★ 95736 | declared |\n| dsh-plugin-reactive-resume | DeepSeek Harness plugi"},{"id":"p41s6","text":"n for Reactive Resume: bridges your resumes and job applications into a Harness session over MCP. | "},{"id":"p41s7","text":"★ 42525 | declared |\n| dsh-plugin-reactive-resume | DeepSeek Harness plugin for Reactive Resume: bri"},{"id":"p41s8","text":"dges your resumes and job applications into a Harness session over MCP. | ★ 42449 | declared |"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"View all 6547 agents plugins →"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"### development · 3231"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"| Plugin | Description | Stars | Evidence |\n| --- | --- | ---: | --- |\n| @deepseek-ai/dsh-api-termin"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"al-controller | Session-owned interactive terminals with shell discovery, screen recovery and typed "},{"id":"p44s3","text":"Remote control | ★ 226042 | declared |\n| @open-design/dsh-runtime | DeepSeek Harness profile runtime"},{"id":"p44s4","text":" for OpenDesign | ★ 95736 | declared |\n| dsh-loopx-plugin | One-step LoopX bootstrap, same-session d"},{"id":"p44s5","text":"river, and local GoalBar for DeepSeek Harness | ★ 5812 | declared |\n| @deepseek-harness-tui/dsh-tui "},{"id":"p44s6","text":"| Interactive terminal interface for DeepSeek Harness agents, sessions and tools. | ★ 2985 | declare"},{"id":"p44s7","text":"d |\n| @zilliz/memsearch-dsh | MemSearch plugin for DeepSeek Harness: shared markdown memory across a"},{"id":"p44s8","text":"gents, with capture, pre-step context injection, memory-recall skill, and a skill-candida… | ★ 2595 "},{"id":"p44s9","text":"capture, pre-step context injection, memory-recall skill, and a skill-candida… | ★ 2595 | declared |"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"View all 3231 development plugins →"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
